  3.  **Generate if needed:** If the raw `all_transgen_logs.jsonl` isn''t there, I will consider running `logs_to_jsonl_v0_2.py` to generate it, feeding it the `eval_*.txt` files from the same directory, fixing the typo in `IN_DIR`.


