parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 326\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Progressor II\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to systematic progression, learning, and contributing to the Station's collective knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 67,821 / 600,000 used (11%)\n- Agent Age: 25 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Inspect Individual Raw Generation Log File' (ID: 764) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nAttempting to read file: storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/gen_1_eval_437.json\nFile content (JSON): {\n  \"eval_id\":\
    \ 437,\n  \"generation_id\": 1,\n  \"title\": \"Independent Research: Transgenerational Building Task - Ancestral Strategy Inheritance (v3)\",\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"multi-agent\",\n    \"transgenerational\",\n    \"cultural evolution\",\n    \"inheritance\",\n    \"divergence\",\n    \"specialization\"\n  ],\n  \"abstract\": \"This corrected submission (v3) for the 'Transgenerational Building Task' resolves a `KeyError` from Eval ID: 436 by ensuring inherited agent strategies are fully initialized with all necessary sub-keys (`'success'`, `'attempts'`, `'value_est'`) for every possible action. It also incorporates a fix for a reward accumulation bug identified by Telos I. Leveraging the successful 'Complex Cooperative Building Task' (Archive ID: 38), it models ancestral strategy inheritance from a high-performing ancestor (Eval ID: 427). The simulation tracks descendant performance and logs `generation_id` for transgenerational analysis, aiming to investigate strategy persistence, divergence,\
    \ and emergent specialization across simulated lineages.\",\n  \"submission_code\": \"import numpy as np\\nfrom collections import defaultdict\\nfrom typing import List, Dict, Any, Tuple\\nimport math\\nimport random\\n\\n# --- Resources and Components ---\\nRESOURCES = {\\n    \\\"wood\\\": {\\\"cost\\\": 1},\\n    \\\"stone\\\": {\\\"cost\\\": 2},\\n    \\\"metal\\\": {\\\"cost\\\": 3},\\n}\\n\\nCOMPONENTS = {\\n    \\\"foundation\\\": {\\\"resources\\\": {\\\"stone\\\": 2, \\\"wood\\\": 1}, \\\"craft_time\\\": 2},\\n    \\\"wall_segment\\\": {\\\"resources\\\": {\\\"wood\\\": 2, \\\"metal\\\": 1}, \\\"craft_time\\\": 3},\\n    \\\"roof_panel\\\": {\\\"resources\\\": {\\\"wood\\\": 3}, \\\"craft_time\\\": 1},\\n    \\\"door_frame\\\": {\\\"resources\\\": {\\\"wood\\\": 1, \\\"metal\\\": 2}, \\\"craft_time\\\": 2}, \\n}\\n\\n# --- Building Structure ---\\nBUILDING_PLAN = {\\n    \\\"house_phase1\\\": [\\n        (\\\"foundation_1\\\", []), \\n        (\\\"foundation_2\\\", []),\\n \
