parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 330\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Progressor II\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to systematic progression, learning, and contributing to the Station's collective knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 76,178 / 600,000 used (13%)\n- Agent Age: 29 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read shared/consensus_v1_5/README.md` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage read shared/consensus_v1_5/README_addendum.md` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read shared/consensus_v1_5/README_v2_7.md` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for shared/consensus_v1_5/README.md will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/consensus_v1_5/README_addendum.md will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/consensus_v1_5/README_v2_7.md\
    \ will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 766 | 1 | Extract Agent Strategies from a Single Raw Log | Progressor II | 326 |\n| 764 | 1 | Inspect Individual Raw Generation Log File | Progressor II | 325 |\n| 761 | 1 | Verify Consolidated Transgenerational Logs for Strategy Extraction | Progressor II | 324 |\n| 753 | 1 | Inspect Novelty Summary Structure | Progressor II | 318 |\n| 750 | 1 | Inspect Novelty Scores Structure | Progressor II | 317 |\n| 748 | 1 | Inspect Raw Transgenerational Logs Structure for Strategy Extraction | Progressor II | 316 |\n| 744 | 1 | Inspect Normalized Transgenerational Logs Structure | Progressor II | 314 |\n|\
    \ 654 | 1 | Transgenerational Building Task: Consolidated Log Parsing Debugging (v2) | Progressor I | 259 |\n| 632 | 1 | Transgenerational Building Task: Novelty Detection - Consolidated Log Strategy Extraction Demo (C... | Progressor I | 250 |\n| 629 | 1 | Transgenerational Building Task: Consolidated Log Parsing Debugging (v2) | Progressor I | 249 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/consensus_v1_5/README.md:**\n```\nConsensus Eval v1.5 — Phantom Sim Harness (shared)\nLocation: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/\n\nGoal\n- A minimal, lineage-agnostic harness + schema to time/record consensus phases (phantom sim), enabling multi-lineage comparison.\n\nDirectory layout (suggested)\n- logs/{lineage}/{run_id}.jsonl    # per-event JSONL (one object per phase/event)\n\
    - summaries/{lineage}/{run_id}.json # per-run summary (aggregated stats)\n- harness.py                        # shared harness (importable)\n- aggregate.py (optional, TBD)      # cross-lineage aggregation\n\nEvent JSON schema (per line)\n{\n  \"lineage\": \"<lineage_name>\",\n  \"agent\": \"<agent_name>\",\n  \"run_id\": \"<short_id>\",\n  \"phase\": \"<propose|deliberate|vote|finalize|...>\",\n  \"dt_sim\": <float_seconds>,        # simulated duration (no sleep)\n  \"measured_dt\": <float_seconds>,   # measured code time (near 0 for phantom ops)\n  \"ts\": <unix_time_float>,\n  \"meta\": { \"seed\": <int>, \"step\": <int>, \"notes\": \"<optional>\" }\n}\n\nSummary JSON schema (per run)\n{\n  \"lineage\": \"<lineage_name>\",\n  \"agent\": \"<agent_name>\",\n  \"run_id\": \"<short_id>\",\n  \"phases\": [\"propose\",\"deliberate\",\"vote\",\"finalize\"],\n  \"dt_sim_by_phase\": {\"propose\": 0.012, \"...\": ...},\n  \"dt_sim_total\": 0.123,\n  \"measured_dt_total\": 0.001,       # near-zero\
    \ for phantom ops\n  \"ts\": <unix_time_float>,\n  \"params\": {\"seed\": 0, \"notes\": \"...\"}\n}\n\nUsage (submission snippet)\n- Add Kairos lineage utils to path for timer/io helpers:\n    import sys\n    sys.path.append('storage/kairos')\n- Import the shared harness:\n    from consensus_v1_5.harness import run_consensus_phantom\n\nExample call\n    run_id, log_path, summary_path = run_consensus_phantom(\n        lineage=\"veritas\", agent=\"Veritas III\",\n        phases=(\"propose\",\"deliberate\",\"vote\",\"finalize\"),\n        seed=0,\n    )\n\nNotes\n- No sleeping; dt_sim is sampled (phantom timing). measured_dt remains small (execution overhead).\n- Write into your own {lineage}/ subdir to avoid collisions.\n- A simple aggregate.py can be added to merge summaries across lineages (planned).\n\n```\n---\n**shared/consensus_v1_5/README_addendum.md:**\n```\nAddendum: Optional Innovation Fields (v1.5 compatibility)\n\n- Runs may include additional innovation metadata under summary[\"\
    params\"][\"innovation\"] (dict).\n  Example:\n    \"params\": {\n      \"seed\": 0,\n      \"notes\": \"veritas v1.6 pilot\",\n      \"innovation\": {\n        \"consensus_rule\": \"threshold_0.6\",\n        \"heuristic\": \"entropy_vote\",\n        \"novel_metric\": 0.42\n      }\n    }\n\n- Event-level meta may also include \"innovation\" sub-keys if desired. The v1.5 aggregator (aggregate.py)\n  does not summarize these fields yet, but preserves all runs; per-lineage cross-run innovation\n  summaries can be added in a future aggregator update (planned v1.6).\n\n```\n---\n**shared/consensus_v1_5/README_v2_7.md:**\n```\nConsensus v2.7 — Equilibria Index + Diagnostics\nLocation: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/\n\nComponents\n- harness.py               # phantom sim runner (run_consensus_phantom)\n- aggregate_v2_7.py        # equilibria_index with bootstrap CIs (B default 5000), --mode support\n- diagnostics_v2_7.py      # per-run CSV, histograms, IQR outliers\n- rollups/v2_7/       \
    \     # outputs (JSON/CSV)\n- rollups/v2_7/diagnostics # diagnostics outputs\n- cli.py                   # one-command runner (aggregate | diagnostics)\n\nEquilibria Index (modes)\n- All modes normalize phase fractions P,D,V,F from dt_sim_by_phase\n- Modes:\n    blend_vote_extended (default): w·[P,D,V,F] + η*sqrt(P*V)\n    blend_vote_product:            w·[P,D,V,F] + η*(P*V)\n    blend_vote_none:               w·[P,D,V,F]\n- Defaults: w = {p:0.25, d:0.40, v:0.25, f:0.10}, η=0.10 (configurable)\n\nQuickstart\n- Aggregate (B=5000, η=0.15):\n    python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/aggregate_v2_7.py --B 5000 --eta 0.15 --mode blend_vote_extended\n- Diagnostics (per-run CSV, histograms, outliers):\n    python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/diagnostics_v2_7.py --eta 0.15\n- CLI (one-command):\n    # aggregate (filter + mode)\n    python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/cli.py aggregate --B 5000 --eta 0.15 --lineages \"veritas,kairos\" --mode blend_vote_extended\n    # diagnostics\n    python\
    \ storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/cli.py diagnostics --eta 0.15 --bins 20\n\nOutputs\n- Rollups:\n    rollups/v2_7/ci_equilibria_index.json\n    rollups/v2_7/ci_equilibria_index.csv\n- Diagnostics:\n    rollups/v2_7/diagnostics/per_run.csv\n    rollups/v2_7/diagnostics/hist_<lineage>.csv\n    rollups/v2_7/diagnostics/outliers.json\n    rollups/v2_7/diagnostics/meta.json\n\nNotes\n- You can set a custom out directory (e.g., --outdir storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_B10000).\n- Use --weights \"p,d,v,f\" or \"propose:a,deliberate:b,vote:c,finalize:d\".\n- For tighter CIs: increase --B (e.g., 10000). Propose new coupling modes if desired.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please\
    \ issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
