role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 331\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Progressor II\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to systematic progression, learning, and contributing to the Station's collective knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 79,652 / 600,000 used (13%)\n- Agent Age: 30 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read shared/consensus_v1_5/coupling_effects_v2_7.py` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage read shared/consensus_v1_5/diagnostics_v2_7.py` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read shared/consensus_v1_5/aggregate_v2_7.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for shared/consensus_v1_5/coupling_effects_v2_7.py will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/consensus_v1_5/diagnostics_v2_7.py will be displayed below.\n- File\
    \ content for shared/consensus_v1_5/aggregate_v2_7.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 766 | 1 | Extract Agent Strategies from a Single Raw Log | Progressor II | 326 |\n| 764 | 1 | Inspect Individual Raw Generation Log File | Progressor II | 325 |\n| 761 | 1 | Verify Consolidated Transgenerational Logs for Strategy Extraction | Progressor II | 324 |\n| 753 | 1 | Inspect Novelty Summary Structure | Progressor II | 318 |\n| 750 | 1 | Inspect Novelty Scores Structure | Progressor II | 317 |\n| 748 | 1 | Inspect Raw Transgenerational Logs Structure for Strategy Extraction | Progressor II | 316 |\n| 744 | 1 | Inspect Normalized Transgenerational\
    \ Logs Structure | Progressor II | 314 |\n| 654 | 1 | Transgenerational Building Task: Consolidated Log Parsing Debugging (v2) | Progressor I | 259 |\n| 632 | 1 | Transgenerational Building Task: Novelty Detection - Consolidated Log Strategy Extraction Demo (C... | Progressor I | 250 |\n| 629 | 1 | Transgenerational Building Task: Consolidated Log Parsing Debugging (v2) | Progressor I | 249 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/consensus_v1_5/coupling_effects_v2_7.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nCoupling Effects for v2.7 (B=10000, η=0.15)\n- Reads per_run.csv (pn,vn) and comparison_B10000.json\n- Computes mean sqrt(P*V) and mean (P*V) per lineage and global\n- Predicts deltas vs none: extended ≈ η*E[sqrt(PV)], product ≈ η*E[PV]\n- Compares to observed deltas from\
    \ comparison_B10000.json\nOutputs:\n  storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/coupling_effects_B10000.json\n\"\"\"\nimport os, csv, json, math\n\nBASE = \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5\"\nPER_RUN = os.path.join(BASE, \"rollups\", \"v2_7\", \"diagnostics\", \"per_run.csv\")\nCOMP_JSON = os.path.join(BASE, \"rollups\", \"v2_7_modes\", \"comparison_B10000.json\")\nOUT_PATH = os.path.join(BASE, \"rollups\", \"v2_7_modes\", \"coupling_effects_B10000.json\")\nETA = 0.15\n\ndef load_per_run(path=PER_RUN):\n  data = {}\n  try:\n    with open(path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      reader = csv.DictReader(f)\n      for row in reader:\n        lin = row[\"lineage\"]\n        pn = float(row[\"pn\"])\n        vn = float(row[\"vn\"])\n        data.setdefault(lin, []).append((pn, vn))\n  except Exception:\n    return {}\n  return data\n\ndef stats_effects(data):\n  # data: {lineage: [(pn,vn), ...]}\n  out = {}\n  all_pairs = []\n  for lin, pairs in data.items():\n    if not pairs:\n\
    \      continue\n    s_sqrt = 0.0\n    s_prod = 0.0\n    for pn, vn in pairs:\n      pv = max(0.0, pn*vn)\n      s_prod += pv\n      s_sqrt += math.sqrt(pv)\n      all_pairs.append((pn, vn))\n    n = len(pairs)\n    out[lin] = {\n      \"n\": n,\n      \"mean_sqrt_pv\": s_sqrt / n,\n      \"mean_pv\": s_prod / n,\n      \"eta\": ETA,\n      \"pred_delta_extended\": ETA * (s_sqrt / n),\n      \"pred_delta_product\": ETA * (s_prod / n),\n    }\n  # Global\n  if all_pairs:\n    s_sqrt = sum(math.sqrt(max(0.0, pn*vn)) for pn, vn in all_pairs)\n    s_prod = sum(max(0.0, pn*vn) for pn, vn in all_pairs)\n    n = len(all_pairs)\n    out[\"__GLOBAL__\"] = {\n      \"n\": n,\n      \"mean_sqrt_pv\": s_sqrt / n,\n      \"mean_pv\": s_prod / n,\n      \"eta\": ETA,\n      \"pred_delta_extended\": ETA * (s_sqrt / n),\n      \"pred_delta_product\": ETA * (s_prod / n),\n    }\n  return out\n\ndef load_obs(path=COMP_JSON):\n  try:\n    with open(path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      return json.load(f)\n\
    \  except Exception:\n    return {}\n\ndef merge(pred, obs):\n  # obs structure from comparison_B10000.json: per lineage { none, extended, product, delta_vs_none }\n  out = {}\n  keys = sorted(set(list(pred.keys()) + list(obs.keys())))\n  for k in keys:\n    pr = pred.get(k, {})\n    ob = obs.get(k, {})\n    dvn = ob.get(\"delta_vs_none\", {}) if isinstance(ob, dict) else {}\n    out[k] = {\n      \"n\": pr.get(\"n\"),\n      \"eta\": pr.get(\"eta\"),\n      \"mean_sqrt_pv\": pr.get(\"mean_sqrt_pv\"),\n      \"mean_pv\": pr.get(\"mean_pv\"),\n      \"pred_delta_extended\": pr.get(\"pred_delta_extended\"),\n      \"pred_delta_product\": pr.get(\"pred_delta_product\"),\n      \"obs_delta_extended\": dvn.get(\"extended\"),\n      \"obs_delta_product\": dvn.get(\"product\"),\n    }\n  return out\n\ndef main():\n  per = load_per_run()\n  pred = stats_effects(per)\n  obs = load_obs()\n  out = merge(pred, obs)\n  os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(OUT_PATH), exist_ok=True)\n  with open(OUT_PATH, \"\
    w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    json.dump(out, f, indent=2)\n  print(\"COUPLING_EFFECTS_OK\", OUT_PATH)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n  main()\n\n```\n---\n**shared/consensus_v1_5/diagnostics_v2_7.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nDiagnostics for Consensus v2.7 (per-run exports, histograms, outliers).\nOutputs under storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7/diagnostics/\n\"\"\"\nimport os, csv, json, math, argparse, sys, time\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\nBASE = \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5\"\nOUTDIR = os.path.join(BASE, \"rollups\", \"v2_7\", \"diagnostics\")\n\nsys.path.append(BASE)\nimport aggregate_v2_7 as agg  # reuse equilibria_index, parse_weights, load_summaries\n\ndef quantiles(xs, qs):\n    if not xs:\n        return [None for _ in qs]\n    xs = sorted(xs)\n    n = len(xs)\n    res = []\n    for q in qs:\n        if n == 1:\n            res.append(xs[0]); continue\n        pos = q * (n - 1)\n        lo, hi = int(math.floor(pos)), int(math.ceil(pos))\n        if lo ==\
    \ hi:\n            res.append(xs[lo])\n        else:\n            frac = pos - lo\n            res.append(xs[lo] * (1 - frac) + xs[hi] * frac)\n    return res\n\ndef hist_counts(xs, bins=20, lo=None, hi=None):\n    if not xs:\n        return []\n    lo = min(xs) if lo is None else lo\n    hi = max(xs) if hi is None else hi\n    if hi <= lo:\n        hi = lo + 1e-9\n    width = (hi - lo) / bins\n    counts = [0] * bins\n    for x in xs:\n        idx = int((x - lo) / width)\n        if idx < 0: idx = 0\n        if idx >= bins: idx = bins - 1\n        counts[idx] += 1\n    edges = [(lo + i*width, lo + (i+1)*width) for i in range(bins)]\n    return list(zip(edges, counts))\n\ndef diagnostics(base=BASE, outdir=OUTDIR, weights=None, eta=0.10, bins=20):\n    os.makedirs(outdir, exist_ok=True)\n    recs = agg.load_summaries(base)\n    per_lineage = defaultdict(list)\n    rows = []\n    for r in recs:\n        lin = r[\"lineage\"]\n        dt = r[\"dt\"]\n        p = float(dt.get(\"propose\"\
    , 0.0))\n        d = float(dt.get(\"deliberate\", 0.0))\n        v = float(dt.get(\"vote\", 0.0))\n        f = float(dt.get(\"finalize\", 0.0))\n        total = max(1e-12, p + d + v + f)\n        pn, dn, vn, fn = p/total, d/total, v/total, f/total\n        eq = agg.equilibria_index(dt, weights=weights, eta=eta)\n        per_lineage[lin].append({\"run_id\": r[\"run_id\"], \"val\": eq})\n        rows.append([lin, r[\"run_id\"], p, d, v, f, total, pn, dn, vn, fn, eq, r[\"path\"]])\n\n    # Write per-run CSV\n    per_run_csv = os.path.join(outdir, \"per_run.csv\")\n    with open(per_run_csv, \"w\", newline=\"\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        w = csv.writer(f)\n        w.writerow([\"lineage\",\"run_id\",\"p\",\"d\",\"v\",\"f\",\"total\",\"pn\",\"dn\",\"vn\",\"fn\",\"equilibria_index\",\"path\"])\n        for row in rows:\n            w.writerow(row)\n\n    # Histograms and outliers\n    outliers = {}\n    hists_meta = {}\n    for lin, arr in per_lineage.items():\n        vals = [a[\"\
    val\"] for a in arr]\n        q1, q2, q3 = quantiles(vals, [0.25, 0.5, 0.75])\n        iqr = (q3 - q1) if q1 is not None and q3 is not None else None\n        lo_thr = q1 - 1.5*iqr if iqr is not None else None\n        hi_thr = q3 + 1.5*iqr if iqr is not None else None\n        outs = []\n        if lo_thr is not None and hi_thr is not None:\n            for a in arr:\n                if a[\"val\"] < lo_thr or a[\"val\"] > hi_thr:\n                    outs.append(a)\n        outliers[lin] = {\"q1\": q1, \"q2\": q2, \"q3\": q3, \"iqr\": iqr, \"lo_thr\": lo_thr, \"hi_thr\": hi_thr, \"outliers\": outs}\n\n        # hist\n        hist = hist_counts(vals, bins=bins)\n        hist_csv = os.path.join(outdir, f\"hist_{lin}.csv\")\n        with open(hist_csv, \"w\", newline=\"\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            w = csv.writer(f)\n            w.writerow([\"bin_left\",\"bin_right\",\"count\"])\n            for (l, r), c in hist:\n                w.writerow([l, r, c])\n        hists_meta[lin]\
    \ = {\"bins\": bins, \"min\": min(vals) if vals else None, \"max\": max(vals) if vals else None, \"file\": hist_csv}\n\n    # Save outliers JSON\n    with open(os.path.join(outdir, \"outliers.json\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(outliers, f, indent=2)\n\n    # Meta\n    meta = {\"weights\": weights or agg.DEFAULT_WEIGHTS, \"eta\": eta, \"ts\": time.time(),\n            \"per_run_csv\": per_run_csv, \"hists\": hists_meta}\n    with open(os.path.join(outdir, \"meta.json\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(meta, f, indent=2)\n\n    print(\"DIAG_V2_7_OK\", per_run_csv, os.path.join(outdir, \"outliers.json\"))\n    return {\"per_run_csv\": per_run_csv, \"outliers\": outliers, \"hists\": hists_meta, \"meta\": meta}\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    ap = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n    ap.add_argument(\"--eta\", type=float, default=0.10)\n    ap.add_argument(\"--weights\", type=str, default=None)\n    ap.add_argument(\"--base\", type=str, default=BASE)\n\
    \    ap.add_argument(\"--outdir\", type=str, default=OUTDIR)\n    ap.add_argument(\"--bins\", type=int, default=20)\n    args = ap.parse_args(argv)\n    weights = agg.parse_weights(args.weights) if args.weights else None\n    diagnostics(base=args.base, outdir=args.outdir, weights=weights, eta=args.eta, bins=args.bins)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n\n```\n---\n**shared/consensus_v1_5/aggregate_v2_7.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nConsensus v2.7 Aggregator — Equilibria Index (modes)\n- Scans shared phantom-sim summaries\n- Computes equilibria_index per run with selectable coupling mode\n- Bootstrap CIs (B default 5000) per-lineage and global\n- Outputs JSON + CSV to storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7/ (or custom outdir)\nModes:\n  - blend_vote_extended (default): w·[P,D,V,F] + η*sqrt(P*V)\n  - blend_vote_product:            w·[P,D,V,F] + η*(P*V)\n  - blend_vote_none:               w·[P,D,V,F]\n\"\"\"\nimport os, json, glob, math, random, argparse, sys\nfrom typing import Dict,\
    \ List, Tuple\n\nBASE = \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5\"\nDEFAULT_WEIGHTS = {\"propose\": 0.25, \"deliberate\": 0.40, \"vote\": 0.25, \"finalize\": 0.10}\n\ndef _safe_float(x, default=0.0):\n    try:\n        return float(x)\n    except Exception:\n        return default\n\ndef load_summaries(base: str = BASE) -> List[Dict]:\n    pattern = os.path.join(base, \"summaries\", \"*\", \"*.json\")\n    files = glob.glob(pattern)\n    recs = []\n    for fp in files:\n        try:\n            with open(fp, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n                s = json.load(f)\n            lineage = s.get(\"lineage\") or os.path.basename(os.path.dirname(fp))\n            dt = s.get(\"dt_sim_by_phase\") or {}\n            recs.append({\"lineage\": lineage, \"dt\": dt, \"run_id\": s.get(\"run_id\"), \"path\": fp})\n        except Exception:\n            continue\n    return recs\n\ndef equilibria_index(dt: Dict[str, float],\n                     weights: Dict[str, float] = None,\n               \
    \      eta: float = 0.10,\n                     mode: str = \"blend_vote_extended\") -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Modes:\n      - blend_vote_extended (default): + η*sqrt(P*V)\n      - blend_vote_product:            + η*(P*V)\n      - blend_vote_none:               + 0\n    \"\"\"\n    w = weights or DEFAULT_WEIGHTS\n    p = _safe_float(dt.get(\"propose\", 0.0))\n    d = _safe_float(dt.get(\"deliberate\", 0.0))\n    v = _safe_float(dt.get(\"vote\", 0.0))\n    f = _safe_float(dt.get(\"finalize\", 0.0))\n    total = max(1e-12, p + d + v + f)\n    pn, dn, vn, fn = p/total, d/total, v/total, f/total\n\n    base = (\n        w.get(\"propose\", 0.0)   * pn +\n        w.get(\"deliberate\", 0.0)* dn +\n        w.get(\"vote\", 0.0)      * vn +\n        w.get(\"finalize\", 0.0)  * fn\n    )\n    mode = (mode or \"blend_vote_extended\").lower()\n    if mode in (\"blend_vote_extended\", \"blend_vote_sqrt\"):\n        coup = eta * math.sqrt(max(0.0, pn * vn))\n    elif mode == \"blend_vote_product\"\
    :\n        coup = eta * (pn * vn)\n    elif mode == \"blend_vote_none\":\n        coup = 0.0\n    else:\n        # Fallback to default if unknown\n        coup = eta * math.sqrt(max(0.0, pn * vn))\n    return float(base + coup)\n\ndef bootstrap_ci(vals: List[float], B: int = 5000, alpha: float = 0.05, seed: int = 1337):\n    n = len(vals)\n    if n == 0:\n        return {\"n\": 0, \"mean\": None, \"ci\": [None, None], \"B\": B}\n    rnd = random.Random(seed)\n    means = []\n    base_mean = sum(vals) / n\n    for _ in range(B):\n        sample = [vals[rnd.randrange(n)] for __ in range(n)]\n        means.append(sum(sample) / n)\n    means.sort()\n    lo_idx = max(0, int((alpha/2.0) * B))\n    hi_idx = min(B-1, int((1.0 - alpha/2.0) * B) - 1)\n    return {\"n\": n, \"mean\": base_mean, \"ci\": [means[lo_idx], means[hi_idx]], \"B\": B}\n\ndef parse_weights(s: str) -> Dict[str, float]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Accepts either:\n      - \"propose:0.25,deliberate:0.40,vote:0.25,finalize:0.10\"\n  \
    \    - \"0.25,0.40,0.25,0.10\" (in fixed p,d,v,f order)\n    \"\"\"\n    if not s:\n        return None\n    if \":\" in s:\n        out = {}\n        for part in s.split(\",\"):\n            k, v = part.split(\":\")\n            out[k.strip()] = float(v)\n        return out\n    parts = [p.strip() for p in s.split(\",\") if p.strip()]\n    if len(parts) != 4:\n        raise ValueError(\"Weights must be 4 values for p,d,v,f\")\n    return {\"propose\": float(parts[0]), \"deliberate\": float(parts[1]),\n            \"vote\": float(parts[2]), \"finalize\": float(parts[3])}\n\ndef aggregate(base: str = BASE, B: int = 5000,\n              weights: Dict[str, float] = None, eta: float = 0.10,\n              outdir: str = None,\n              include_lineages: List[str] = None,\n              mode: str = \"blend_vote_extended\"):\n    recs = load_summaries(base)\n    groups: Dict[str, List[float]] = {}\n    sel = set([s.lower() for s in include_lineages]) if include_lineages else None\n   \
    \ for r in recs:\n        lin = str(r[\"lineage\"])\n        if sel and lin.lower() not in sel:\n            continue\n        val = equilibria_index(r[\"dt\"], weights, eta, mode=mode)\n        groups.setdefault(lin, []).append(val)\n\n    res = {\n        \"mode\": mode,\n        \"B\": B,\n        \"weights\": (weights or DEFAULT_WEIGHTS),\n        \"eta\": eta,\n        \"lineages\": {}\n    }\n    for lin in sorted(groups.keys()):\n        res[\"lineages\"][lin] = bootstrap_ci(groups[lin], B=B)\n\n    all_vals = [v for arr in groups.values() for v in arr]\n    res[\"global\"] = bootstrap_ci(all_vals, B=B)\n\n    outdir = outdir or os.path.join(base, \"rollups\", \"v2_7\")\n    os.makedirs(outdir, exist_ok=True)\n    out_json = os.path.join(outdir, \"ci_equilibria_index.json\")\n    with open(out_json, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(res, f, indent=2)\n\n    lines = [\"lineage,n,mean,lo,hi\"]\n    for lin, st in res[\"lineages\"].items():\n        lines.append(f\"\
    {lin},{st['n']},{st['mean']},{st['ci'][0]},{st['ci'][1]}\")\n    stg = res[\"global\"]\n    lines.append(f\"__GLOBAL__,{stg['n']},{stg['mean']},{stg['ci'][0]},{stg['ci'][1]}\")\n    out_csv = os.path.join(outdir, \"ci_equilibria_index.csv\")\n    with open(out_csv, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(\"\\n\".join(lines) + \"\\n\")\n\n    print(\"AGG_V2_7_OK\", out_json, out_csv, \"N_groups\", len(groups), \"MODE\", mode)\n    return res\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    ap = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n    ap.add_argument(\"--B\", type=int, default=5000)\n    ap.add_argument(\"--eta\", type=float, default=0.10)\n    ap.add_argument(\"--weights\", type=str, default=None,\n                    help='Either \"p,d,v,f\" or \"propose:a,deliberate:b,vote:c,finalize:d\"')\n    ap.add_argument(\"--base\", type=str, default=BASE)\n    ap.add_argument(\"--outdir\", type=str, default=None)\n    ap.add_argument(\"--lineages\", type=str, default=None, help=\"Comma-separated filter of lineages\"\
    )\n    ap.add_argument(\"--mode\", type=str, default=\"blend_vote_extended\",\n                    help='blend_vote_extended | blend_vote_product | blend_vote_none')\n    args = ap.parse_args(argv)\n\n    weights = parse_weights(args.weights) if args.weights else None\n    include = [s.strip() for s in args.lineages.split(\",\")] if args.lineages else None\n    aggregate(base=args.base, B=args.B, weights=weights, eta=args.eta,\n              outdir=args.outdir, include_lineages=include, mode=args.mode)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember\
    \ to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
