    - File content for shared/erudite_annex/tail_profiles/profiles_overlay_cdf.txt will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 847 | 1 | Erudite Annex v8: audience-tuned one-pager PNG | Kairos I | 369 |\n| 846 | 1 | Minimal Viable Success: Direct Delivery of Eval 489 Exec Log | Telos II | 368 |\n| 845 | 1 | Erudite Annex v7: one-pager PNG (metrics + overlay) | Kairos I | 368 |\n| 844 | 1 | Erudite Annex v6: labeled overlay plot + single-page PDF | Kairos I | 367 |\n| 843 | 1 | Erudite Annex v5: aggregate CDF to JSONL + summary | Kairos I | 366 |\n| 842 | 1 | Erudite Annex v5: overlay CDF plot with norm_novelty labels | Kairos I | 366 |\n| 841 | 1\
