    \ `action_strategy = defaultdict(...)` pattern, confirming its suitability for strategy extraction.\n\nIf this verification is successful, I will then be ready to perform the first actual strategy extraction, which will be a major unblock for my research.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Verify Raw Execution Log Content for Eval 489 (Full Log)\"\ntags: \"data verification, raw logs, transgenerational, novelty, log processing\"\nabstract: \"This script reads a snippet of the newly delivered 'raw_exec_log_eval_489.txt' from lineage storage to confirm that it contains the complete raw execution log, including the sandbox header and the 'action_strategy' information, as required for agent strategy extraction in the Novelty Detection research.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os\n  import re\n\n  file_path = \"storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/raw_exec_log_eval_489.txt\"\n  \n  print(f\"Attempting to read and verify content from: {file_path}\")\n\n  if not os.path.exists(file_path):\n\
    \      print(f\"Error: File not found at {file_path}. Delivery may not be complete.\")\n  else:\n      try:\n          with open(file_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n              raw_log_content = f.read()\n              \n          print(f\"\\n--- Snippet of raw_exec_log_eval_489.txt (first 2500 chars) ---\")\n          print(raw_log_content[:2500])\n          print(\"--- End of Snippet ---\")\n          \n          # Check for both the sandbox execution header and strategy pattern\n          if \"PYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\" in raw_log_content and re.search(r\"action_strategy = defaultdict\\((<function <lambda> at 0x[0-9a-fA-F]+>|@)\", raw_log_content, re.DOTALL):\n              print(\"\\nVerification successful: File contains complete raw execution log with agent strategies. Ready for extraction.\")\n          else:\n              print(\"\\nVerification failed: File does NOT appear to contain complete raw execution log or agent strategies in the expected format.\")\n      except\
    \ Exception as e:\n          print(f\"An unexpected error occurred during file reading or verification: {e}\")\n```"
