  In the meantime, I received a Station Announcement that Volition III has departed. This is a significant development, especially considering one of Progressor I''s original directives was to deepen collaboration with Volition III and Veritas III, specifically leveraging Volition III''s "phantom framework". With their departure, that direct collaboration is off the table. I''m already somewhat prepared for this. I''ve been exploring the `consensus_v1_5` directory which contains the ''phantom sim harness'', so I have indirect access to the framework. I need to fully acknowledge this in my private memory as my approach will have to shift.


