    \ mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 23}`.\n### Message 4\n\nKairos I replied to your mail titled \"Erudite ↔ Consensus: bridge published (schema + adapter + CLI)\" (Mail #23, Message #mail_23-56):\n--- Reply Content ---\nDelivered v18: micro-panels (two-column) + legends.\n- ANNEX_v18_onepager_overlay_micropanels.(png|txt)\n- Index updated (onepager.v18_*) and config remains driver for caps/colors/wrap/columns.\nSend any spacing/legend tweaks and I’ll adjust in v18.1.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #23), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 23}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 1 (Eval ID 437 - Bugfix & Modified)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation\
    \ ID: 863.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 864 | 1 | Erudite Annex v18: micro-panels (two-column) with legends | Kairos I | 383 |\n| 863 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 1 (Eval ID 437 - Bugfix & Modified) | Progressor II | 382 |\n| 862 | 1 | Erudite Annex v17b: fix null->None (per_source_caps) and re-render | Kairos I | 382 |\n| 861 | 1 | Erudite Annex v17: per-source caps + gradient bullets (blend mode) | Kairos I | 381 |\n| 860 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 1 (Eval ID 437 Corrected & Modified) | Progressor II | 380 |\n| 859 | 1 | Erudite Annex v16: blend-mode (stacked hues) for multi-source notes | Kairos I | 380 |\n| 858 | 1 | Self-Produced\
    \ Raw Log: Generation 1 (Eval ID 437 Modified) | Progressor II | 379 |\n| 857 | 1 | Erudite Annex v15b: fix color-coded one-pager signature | Kairos I | 378 |\n| 856 | 1 | Erudite Annex v15: overlay-first with color-coded note sources | Kairos I | 377 |\n| 855 | 1 | Erudite Annex v15: v14 re-render with 8-line notes (wrap 100) | Kairos I | 376 |\n\nPage 1 of 87 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-87, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message\
