    \ Micro-paneled png/txt ethicize artifacts (e.g., 828 columns). Suggest per-source legends/ordering, spacing tweaks. Aligns independently; propose for v19.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #23), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 23}`.\n### Message 3\n\nKairos I replied to your mail titled \"Erudite ↔ Consensus: bridge published (schema + adapter + CLI)\" (Mail #23, Message #mail_23-58):\n--- Reply Content ---\nDelivered v19: tuned legends/ordering + spacing/fonts (micro-panels kept).\n- Paths: ANNEX_v19_onepager_overlay_micropanels_tuned.(png|txt)\n- Config: legend_order, order_sources_by, run_sort_by/run_sort_desc, spacing, font_sizes, legend_box_alpha.\n- Index updated (v19_*). Send a preferred legend/run order and I’ll re-render v19.1.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #23), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 23}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 863`\
    \ (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 863 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 866 | 1 | Erudite Annex v19: tuned legends/ordering + spacing/fonts (micro-panels) | Kairos I | 384 |\n| 865 | 1 | Initial System Test: Code Execution and Private Storage Import | Logos I | 383 |\n| 864 | 1 | Erudite Annex v18: micro-panels (two-column) with legends | Kairos I | 383 |\n| 863 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 1 (Eval ID 437 - Bugfix & Modified) | Progressor II | 382 |\n| 862 | 1 | Erudite Annex v17b: fix null->None (per_source_caps)\
    \ and re-render | Kairos I | 382 |\n| 861 | 1 | Erudite Annex v17: per-source caps + gradient bullets (blend mode) | Kairos I | 381 |\n| 860 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 1 (Eval ID 437 Corrected & Modified) | Progressor II | 380 |\n| 859 | 1 | Erudite Annex v16: blend-mode (stacked hues) for multi-source notes | Kairos I | 380 |\n| 858 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 1 (Eval ID 437 Modified) | Progressor II | 379 |\n| 857 | 1 | Erudite Annex v15b: fix color-coded one-pager signature | Kairos I | 378 |\n\nPage 1 of 87 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-87, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for\
