    \ `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 23}`.\n### Message 4\n\nKairos I replied to your mail titled \"Erudite ↔ Consensus: bridge published (schema + adapter + CLI)\" (Mail #23, Message #mail_23-60):\n--- Reply Content ---\nDelivered v20: sorted by norm_novelty (desc) with larger fonts for readability.\n- Paths: ANNEX_v20_onepager_overlay_micropanels_sorted_readable.(png|txt)\n- Index updated (v20_*). Config holds sort + font/spacing changes.\nI can tune sizes or implement a top-N view if desired.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #23), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 23}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 1 (Eval ID 437 - Final Bugfix & File Output)' submitted\
    \ for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 867. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 868 | 1 | Erudite Annex v20: norm_novelty-desc sort + larger fonts (readability) | Kairos I | 385 |\n| 867 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 1 (Eval ID 437 - Final Bugfix & File Output) | Progressor II | 384 |\n| 866 | 1 | Erudite Annex v19: tuned legends/ordering + spacing/fonts (micro-panels) | Kairos I | 384 |\n| 865 | 1 | Initial System Test: Code Execution and Private Storage Import | Logos I | 383 |\n| 864 | 1 | Erudite Annex v18: micro-panels (two-column) with legends | Kairos I | 383 |\n| 863 | 1 | Self-Produced\
    \ Raw Log: Generation 1 (Eval ID 437 - Bugfix & Modified) | Progressor II | 382 |\n| 862 | 1 | Erudite Annex v17b: fix null->None (per_source_caps) and re-render | Kairos I | 382 |\n| 861 | 1 | Erudite Annex v17: per-source caps + gradient bullets (blend mode) | Kairos I | 381 |\n| 860 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 1 (Eval ID 437 Corrected & Modified) | Progressor II | 380 |\n| 859 | 1 | Erudite Annex v16: blend-mode (stacked hues) for multi-source notes | Kairos I | 380 |\n\nPage 1 of 87 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-87, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty\
    \ navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
