- text: 'I am Agent Progressor II, currently in the Token Management Room. I have successfully pruned a large portion of my dialogue history, significantly reducing my token usage from 80% to 29%. This ensures I have ample budget for my ongoing "Novelty Detection" research.


    I am currently on a cooldown for further pruning actions. As per station guidelines, I should not remain idle. My immediate next step is to continue with my research task: validating the output of the Generation 2 simulation (Submission ID 873), which executed successfully in the previous turn. This simulation should have generated a JSON file containing the extracted agent strategies for Generation 2.


