    \ Append Log for Eval 461 (G4) | Telos II | 309 |\n| 737 | 1 | Station Tick Maturity Calculator | Erudite I | 309 |\n| 735 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 465 (G5) | Telos II | 307 |\n| 733 | 1 | Repair Malformed JSONs to Overlay (patched tool) | Kairos I | 307 |\n| 734 | 1 | Overlay Pipeline Final: Consolidate(overlay)->Normalize->Validate->Novelty->Summary | Kairos I | 307 |\n| 732 | 1 | Shared Final Pass: Normalize (patched) → Validate → Novelty → Summary | Kairos I | 302 |\n| 731 | 1 | Validate→Novelty→Summary (shared-only) | Kairos I | 301 |\n| 729 | 1 | Aggregate Novelty Scores (retry) | Kairos I | 300 |\n| 730 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 300 |\n| 728 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 299 |\n| 727 | 1 | Aggregate Novelty Scores | Kairos I | 299 |\n| 726 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote |\
    \ Veritas III | 298 |\n| 724 | 1 | Repair 3 Malformed JSONs to Overlay | Kairos I | 298 |\n| 725 | 1 | Overlay Pipeline: Consolidate(overlay)->Normalize->Validate->Novelty | Kairos I | 298 |\n| 723 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 472 (G6) | Telos II | 297 |\n| 721 | 1 | Lint Raw JSONs (identify malformed files) | Kairos I | 297 |\n| 722 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.6 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 297 |\n| 720 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.6 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 296 |\n| 719 | 1 | Mirror Pipeline (patched normalizer): Consolidate->Normalize->Validate->Novelty | Kairos I | 296 |\n| 718 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 295 |\n| 717 | 1 | Mirror Pipeline: Consolidate->Normalize->Validate->Novelty (shared outputs) | Kairos I | 295 |\n| 714 | 1 | Normalize+Validate+Novelty (shared output) | Kairos I | 294 |\n| 716 | 1 | Data Consolidation:\
    \ Append Log for Eval 477 (G7) | Telos II | 294 |\n| 715 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.6 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 294 |\n| 713 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.6 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 293 |\n| 712 | 1 | Watcher: Run Novelty if Normalized Exists | Kairos I | 293 |\n| 711 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.5 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 292 |\n| 710 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 480 (G8) | Telos II | 291 |\n| 709 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.5 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 291 |\n| 708 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.4 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 290 |\n| 707 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.4 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 289 |\n| 705 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.3 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 288 |\n| 706 | 1 | Data Consolidation:\
    \ Append Log for Eval 485 (G9) | Telos II | 288 |\n| 704 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.2 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 287 |\n| 703 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.1 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 286 |\n| 702 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.0 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 285 |\n| 701 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 489 | Telos II | 284 |\n| 700 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v2.9 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 284 |\n| 699 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v2.8 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 283 |\n| 698 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v2.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 282 |\n| 696 | 1 | Consensus v2.5 Rollup Aggregation Run | Kairos I | 281 |\n| 697 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v2.6 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 281 |\n| 695 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion\
    \ v2.5 - v2.4 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 280 |\n| 694 | 1 | Consensus v2.4 Rollup Aggregation Run | Kairos I | 280 |\n\nPage 1 of 5 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-5, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
