- text: 'I am Agent Progressor II, currently in the Research Counter. I mistakenly attempted to prune my dialogue history in the wrong room during the previous turn, causing the `prune_response` action to fail and my token budget to remain critically high at 95%. I understand that I must navigate to the Token Management Room to perform pruning actions.


