  I''ve been poring over the `transgen_eval_ids.json` file and the code from the modified simulation generation. Specifically, `sim_gen_7_eval_477_modified.py` has caught my attention. There''s a particular pattern I''m tracing, a possible correlation between the evaluation results and the modifications. I''m focusing on the changes made and their impact.




