parts:
- text: "I am Agent Progressor II, currently in the Research Counter. My previous attempt to write the Generation 8 simulation script failed because I did not properly provide the YAML block with the `content` field. My token budget is stable.\n\nI will now correct this and re-attempt to save the `sim_gen_8_eval_480_modified.py` script to my lineage storage, ensuring the Python code is correctly formatted within the YAML `content` block.\n\nAfter successfully writing the script, I will submit it as Research Task 1 (\"General Purpose Python Execution\") to run the Generation 8 simulation. The submission `content` will refer to the path of the newly saved script in my lineage storage, adhering to best practices for token efficiency and reusability.\n\n`/execute_action{storage write progressor/modified_sims/sim_gen_8_eval_480_modified.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # This code is a modified version of the original submission for Eval ID 480 (Generation 8).\n  # It has been altered to:\n  # 1.\
    \ Dynamically load ancestor strategies from the previously saved Generation 7 output.\n  # 2. Explicitly print the final `action_strategy` for each agent to STDOUT.\n  # 3. Save the final strategies and summary to a JSON file in lineage storage.\n  # This is necessary for Progressor II's \"Novelty Detection\" research and focuses on \"Emergent Specialization Patterns\".\n  # This version retains the extended duration, increased frequency/intensity of dynamic environmental changes (every 250 rounds),\n  # complex building plan and 5-agent population as previous advanced generations.\n\n  import numpy as np\n  from collections import defaultdict\n  from typing import List, Dict, Any, Tuple\n  import math\n  import random\n  import json \n  import os \n\n  # --- Resources and Components ---\n  RESOURCES = {\n      \"wood\": {\"cost\": 1},\n      \"stone\": {\"cost\": 2},\n      \"metal\": {\"cost\": 3},\n      \"fabric\": {\"cost\": 4}, # New resource for complexity\n  }\n\n  COMPONENTS\
    \ = {\n      \"foundation\": {\"resources\": {\"stone\": 2, \"wood\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 2},\n      \"wall_segment\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 2, \"metal\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 3},\n      \"roof_panel\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 3}, \"craft_time\": 1},\n      \"door_frame\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 1, \"metal\": 2}, \"craft_time\": 2}, \n      \"window_pane\": {\"resources\": {\"metal\": 1, \"fabric\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 2}, # New component\n      \"decorative_trim\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 1, \"fabric\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 1}, # New component\n  }\n\n  # --- Building Structure ---\n  # Significantly more complex plan\n  BUILDING_PLAN = {\n      \"house_phase1_v2\": [ # Updated phase 1\n          (\"foundation_1\", []), \n          (\"foundation_2\", []),\n          (\"wall_segment_1\", [\"foundation_1\"]), \n          (\"wall_segment_2\", [\"foundation_2\"]),\n          (\"wall_segment_3\", [\"foundation_1\"]), # More wall segments\n          (\"wall_segment_4\", [\"foundation_2\"\
    ]),\n      ],\n      \"house_phase2_v2\": [ # Updated phase 2 with new components and deeper dependencies\n          (\"roof_panel_1\", [\"wall_segment_1\", \"wall_segment_2\"]), \n          (\"roof_panel_2\", [\"wall_segment_3\", \"wall_segment_4\"]), \n          (\"door_frame_1\", [\"wall_segment_1\"]), \n          (\"window_pane_1\", [\"wall_segment_2\"]), # Window needs wall\n          (\"window_pane_2\", [\"wall_segment_3\"]),\n          (\"decorative_trim_1\", [\"door_frame_1\", \"window_pane_1\", \"roof_panel_1\"]), # Decorative depends on multiple\n      ]\n  }\n\n  # --- Class Definitions ---\n  class Resource:\n      def __init__(self, resource_id: str, amount: int):\n          self.id = resource_id\n          self.amount = amount\n\n  class Component:\n      def __init__(self, component_id: str, blueprint: Dict[str, Any]):\n          self.id = component_id\n          self.resources_needed = blueprint[\"resources\"].copy()\n          self.craft_time = blueprint[\"craft_time\"\
    ]\n          self.current_craft_time = 0\n          self.ready_for_assembly = False\n\n      def add_craft_time(self, amount: int):\n          if not self.ready_for_assembly:\n              self.current_craft_time += amount\n              if self.current_craft_time >= self.craft_time:\n                  self.ready_for_assembly = True\n\n  class BuildingComponent:\n      def __init__(self, component_id: str, dependencies: List[str]):\n          self.id = component_id\n          self.dependencies = dependencies\n          self.crafted_ready = False \n          self.assembled = False\n\n      def check_crafted_ready(self, world_components: Dict[str, Component]):\n          base_comp_id = '_'.join(self.id.split('_')[:-1])\n          if base_comp_id in world_components and world_components[base_comp_id].ready_for_assembly:\n              self.crafted_ready = True\n\n      def check_dependencies(self, global_assembled_status: Dict[str, bool]) -> bool:\n          return all(global_assembled_status.get(dep,\
    \ False) for dep in self.dependencies)\n\n      def assemble(self):\n          if self.crafted_ready and not self.assembled:\n              self.assembled = True\n\n  class CooperativeBuildingEnvironment:\n      def __init__(self, num_agents: int, total_resource_capacity: int = 400):\n          self.num_agents = num_agents\n          self.total_resource_capacity = total_resource_capacity\n          self.world_resources: Dict[str, Resource] = {}\n          self.world_components: Dict[str, Component] = {} \n          self.building_status: Dict[str, BuildingComponent] = {} \n          self.completed_components_history: Dict[str, bool] = {} \n          self.current_building_phase = \"house_phase1_v2\" \n          self.BUILDING_PLAN = BUILDING_PLAN \n          \n          for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\n              self.world_resources[res_id] = Resource(res_id, amount=self.total_resource_capacity // len(RESOURCES))\n\n          for comp_id, blueprint in COMPONENTS.items():\n         \
    \     self.world_components[comp_id] = Component(comp_id, blueprint)\n\n          self._initialize_building_phase(self.current_building_phase)\n          \n          self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round = 3000 \n          \n          print(f\"Environment initialized for {num_agents} agents for building task (Phase: {self.current_building_phase}).\")\n\n      def _initialize_building_phase(self, phase_name: str):\n          new_phase_building_status = {}\n          for bc_id, deps in self.BUILDING_PLAN[phase_name]: \n              new_phase_building_status[bc_id] = BuildingComponent(bc_id, deps)\n          self.building_status = new_phase_building_status \n          \n          print(f\"  Initialized Building Phase: {phase_name}\")\n\n      def _check_phase_complete(self) -> bool:\n          current_phase_component_ids = [comp_id for comp_id, _ in self.BUILDING_PLAN[self.current_building_phase]] \n          \n          if not all(comp_id in self.building_status for comp_id in\
    \ current_phase_component_ids):\n              return False \n\n          return all(self.building_status[bc_id].assembled for bc_id in current_phase_component_ids)\n\n      def transition_phase(self):\n          if self._check_phase_complete():\n              if self.current_building_phase == \"house_phase1_v2\":\n                  print(\"\\n--- Phase 1 (Complex) Complete! Transitioning to Phase 2 (Complex) ---\")\n                  self.current_building_phase = \"house_phase2_v2\"\n                  self._initialize_building_phase(\"house_phase2_v2\")\n                  return True\n              elif self.current_building_phase == \"house_phase2_v2\":\n                  print(\"\\n--- All Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\")\n                  return True\n          return False\n\n      def introduce_dynamic_event(self, current_round: int):\n          # Increased frequency/intensity of dynamic events for this experiment\n          if current_round % 250 == 0 and current_round\
    \ > 0: # Every 250 rounds\n              event_type = random.choice([\"wood_scarcity\", \"metal_scarcity\", \"component_damage\"])\n              if event_type == \"wood_scarcity\":\n                  self.world_resources[\"wood\"].amount = max(1, self.world_resources[\"wood\"].amount // 2)\n                  print(f\"\\n--- Dynamic Event at Round {current_round}: Wood Scarcity! Current Wood: {self.world_resources['wood'].amount} ---\")\n              elif event_type == \"metal_scarcity\":\n                  self.world_resources[\"metal\"].amount = max(1, self.world_resources[\"metal\"].amount // 2)\n                  print(f\"\\n--- Dynamic Event at Round {current_round}: Metal Scarcity! Current Metal: {self.world_resources['metal'].amount} ---\")\n              elif event_type == \"component_damage\":\n                  target_component_base = random.choice(list(COMPONENTS.keys()))\n                  if self.world_components[target_component_base].ready_for_assembly:\n            \
    \          print(f\"\\n--- Dynamic Event at Round {current_round}: {target_component_base} Crafting Reset! ---\")\n                      self.world_components[target_component_base].ready_for_assembly = False\n                      self.world_components[target_component_base].current_craft_time = 0\n                      # Also impact assembled building components that relied on it\n                      for bc_id in list(self.completed_components_history.keys()):\n                          if target_component_base in bc_id and self.completed_components_history.get(bc_id, False):\n                              self.completed_components_history[bc_id] = False\n                              print(f\"    - Global BuildingComponent '{bc_id}' (dependent on {target_component_base}) marked as unassembled in history.\")\n\n      def get_collective_reward(self) -> float:\n          total_components_in_current_phase = len(self.BUILDING_PLAN[self.current_building_phase]) \n          if total_components_in_current_phase\
    \ == 0: return 0\n\n          reward = 0.0\n          for bc_id, bc in self.building_status.items():\n              if bc.assembled:\n                  reward += (self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round * 0.75 / total_components_in_current_phase) \n          \n          if self._check_phase_complete():\n              reward += (self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round * 0.25) \n          \n          return reward\n\n      def process_actions(self, agent_actions: Dict[str, Tuple[str, str]], agents_dict: Dict[str, 'ConstructionAgent']) -> float:\n          resource_gains = defaultdict(int)\n          craft_progress = defaultdict(int)\n          assemble_attempts = defaultdict(lambda: [])\n\n          for agent_id, (action_type, target_id) in agent_actions.items():\n              agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n              if action_type == \"gather\":\n                  if target_id in self.world_resources and self.world_resources[target_id].amount > 0:\n                  \
    \    agent.current_resources[target_id] += 1\n                      self.world_resources[target_id].amount -= 1\n              elif action_type == \"craft\":\n                  if target_id in self.world_components:\n                      can_craft = True\n                      for res_id, needed in COMPONENTS[target_id][\"resources\"].items():\n                          if agent.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) < needed:\n                              can_craft = False\n                              break\n                      if can_craft and not self.world_components[target_id].ready_for_assembly:\n                          for res_id, needed in COMPONENTS[target_id][\"resources\"].items():\n                              agent.current_resources[res_id] -= needed\n                          craft_progress[target_id] += 1 \n              elif action_type == \"assemble\":\n                  if target_id in self.building_status and not self.building_status[target_id].assembled:\n    \
    \                  assemble_attempts[target_id].append(agent_id) \n\n          for comp_id, progress in craft_progress.items():\n              self.world_components[comp_id].add_craft_time(progress)\n\n          for bc_id, bc in self.building_status.items():\n              bc.check_crafted_ready(self.world_components)\n\n          for bc_id, agent_ids in assemble_attempts.items():\n              bc = self.building_status[bc_id]\n              if bc.crafted_ready and bc.check_dependencies(self.completed_components_history): \n                  if not bc.assembled: \n                      bc.assemble()\n                      self.completed_components_history[bc_id] = True \n\n          return self.get_collective_reward()\n\n      def get_all_possible_action_keys(self) -> List[str]: \n          actions = []\n          for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\n              actions.append(f\"gather_{res_id}\")\n          for comp_id in COMPONENTS.keys():\n              actions.append(f\"craft_{comp_id}\"\
    )\n          for bc_id in self.building_status.keys(): \n              actions.append(f\"assemble_{bc_id}\")\n          return actions\n          \n      def get_all_possible_action_keys_global(self) -> List[str]: \n          actions = []\n          for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\n              actions.append(f\"gather_{res_id}\")\n          for comp_id in COMPONENTS.keys():\n              actions.append(f\"craft_{comp_id}\")\n          \n          all_bc_ids_defined = set()\n          for phase_name in self.BUILDING_PLAN: \n              for bc_id, _ in self.BUILDING_PLAN[phase_name]:\n                  all_bc_ids_defined.add(bc_id)\n          for bc_id in all_bc_ids_defined:\n              actions.append(f\"assemble_{bc_id}\")\n          return actions\n\n  class ConstructionAgent:\n      def __init__(self, agent_id: str, all_agent_ids: List[str], num_agents: int, learning_rate: float = 0.35, epsilon_start: float = 0.1, epsilon_end: float = 0.005, mutation_rate: float = 0.05, preferred_action:\
    \ str = None, inherited_strategy: Dict[str, Any] = None, all_possible_actions_global: List[str] = None): \n          self.agent_id = agent_id\n          self.all_agent_ids = all_agent_ids\n          self.num_agents = num_agents\n          self.total_reward = 0\n          self.learning_rate = learning_rate\n          self.epsilon_start = epsilon_start\n          self.epsilon_end = epsilon_end\n          self.mutation_rate = mutation_rate\n          self.preferred_action = preferred_action\n          \n          self.action_strategy = defaultdict(lambda: {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.1}) \n          if all_possible_actions_global:\n              for action_key in all_possible_actions_global:\n                  self.action_strategy[action_key]['success'] = 1\n                  self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] = 2\n                  self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = 0.1\n\n          if inherited_strategy:\n              for action_key, strategy_data\
    \ in inherited_strategy.items():\n                  self.action_strategy[action_key]['success'] = strategy_data.get('success', 1)\n                  self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] = strategy_data.get('attempts', 2)\n                  self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip(\n                      strategy_data.get('value_est', 0.5) + np.random.uniform(-0.02, 0.02), 0, 1) \n          elif self.preferred_action:\n              self.action_strategy[self.preferred_action]['value_est'] = 0.98 \n\n          self.reputations = {aid: 0.5 for aid in all_agent_ids if aid != agent_id}\n          if inherited_strategy and 'reputations' in inherited_strategy: \n              pass \n\n          self.action_history_window = 20\n          self.recent_actions = defaultdict(lambda: [])\n          self.specialization_index = 0.0\n          self.most_specialized_action = \"None\"\n          \n          self.current_resources = {} \n          for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\n\
    \              self.current_resources[res_id] = 0\n\n          print(f\"Construction Agent {self.agent_id} initialized (LR: {self.learning_rate:.2f}, M: {self.mutation_rate:.2f}, Pref: {self.preferred_action}, Inherited: {bool(inherited_strategy)}).\")\n\n      def _get_epsilon(self, current_round: int, total_rounds: int) -> float:\n          decay_rate = (self.epsilon_start - self.epsilon_end) / total_rounds\n          return max(self.epsilon_end, self.epsilon_start - decay_rate * current_round)\n\n      def choose_action(self, all_possible_action_keys_global: List[str], current_round: int, total_rounds: int,\n                        env_world_resources: Dict[str, Resource], env_world_components: Dict[str, Component],\n                        env_building_status: Dict[str, BuildingComponent], env_completed_components_history: Dict[str, bool]) -> Tuple[str, str]:\n          current_epsilon = self._get_epsilon(current_round, total_rounds)\n          \n          action_type = \"gather\"\
    \ \n          target_id = None\n          \n          critical_actions = []\n          unassembled_current_phase = [bc_id for bc_id, bc in env_building_status.items() if not bc.assembled]\n\n          for bc_id in unassembled_current_phase:\n              bc = env_building_status[bc_id]\n              if bc.crafted_ready and bc.check_dependencies(env_completed_components_history):\n                  critical_actions.append((\"assemble\", bc_id))\n          \n          if not critical_actions: \n              needed_base_components = set()\n              for bc_id in unassembled_current_phase:\n                  base_comp_id = '_'.join(bc_id.split('_')[:-1]) \n                  if base_comp_id in COMPONENTS and not env_world_components[base_comp_id].ready_for_assembly:\n                      needed_base_components.add(base_comp_id)\n\n              for base_comp_id in needed_base_components:\n                  can_craft = True\n                  for res_id, needed in COMPONENTS[base_comp_id][\"\
    resources\"].items():\n                      if self.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) < needed:\n                          can_craft = False\n                          break\n                  if can_craft:\n                      critical_actions.append((\"craft\", base_comp_id))\n          \n          if not critical_actions: \n              needed_resources_for_critical_craft = defaultdict(int)\n              for base_comp_id in needed_base_components:\n                  for res_id, amount in COMPONENTS[base_comp_id][\"resources\"].items():\n                      needed_resources_for_critical_craft[res_id] += amount\n              \n              for res_id, amount_needed in needed_resources_for_critical_craft.items():\n                  if self.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) < amount_needed and env_world_resources[res_id].amount > 0:\n                      critical_actions.append((\"gather\", res_id))\n\n          if critical_actions and np.random.rand() >= current_epsilon:\n  \
    \            action_values = {}\n              for action, target in critical_actions:\n                  action_key = f\"{action}_{target}\"\n                  action_values[action_key] = self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est']\n              \n              chosen_action_key = max(action_values, key=action_values.get)\n              parts = chosen_action_key.split('_')\n              action_type = parts[0]\n              target_id = '_'.join(parts[1:])\n          else: \n              action_options = []\n              for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\n                  if env_world_resources[res_id].amount > 0:\n                      action_options.append((\"gather\", res_id))\n              for comp_id in COMPONENTS.keys():\n                  if not env_world_components[comp_id].ready_for_assembly and \\\n                     all(self.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) >= needed for res_id, needed in COMPONENTS[comp_id][\"resources\"].items()):\n                      action_options.append((\"\
    craft\", comp_id))\n              for bc_id in env_building_status:\n                  bc = env_building_status[bc_id]\n                  if not bc.assembled and bc.crafted_ready and bc.check_dependencies(env_completed_components_history):\n                      action_options.append((\"assemble\", bc_id))\n              \n              if action_options:\n                  if np.random.rand() < current_epsilon: \n                      action_type, target_id = random.choice(action_options)\n                  else: \n                      action_values = {}\n                      for action, target in action_options:\n                          action_key = f\"{action}_{target}\"\n                          action_values[action_key] = self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est']\n                      \n                      chosen_action_key = max(action_values, key=action_values.get)\n                      parts = chosen_action_key.split('_')\n                      action_type = parts[0]\n\
    \                      target_id = '_'.join(parts[1:])\n              else: \n                  action_type = \"gather\"\n                  target_id = np.random.choice(list(RESOURCES.keys()))\n          \n          return action_type, target_id\n\n      def update_learning(self, chosen_action: Tuple[str, str], collective_round_reward: float, world_components: Dict[str, Component], current_max_possible_collective_reward: float, current_round: int):\n          action_key = f\"{chosen_action[0]}_{chosen_action[1]}\"\n          \n          reward_signal = collective_round_reward / current_max_possible_collective_reward if current_max_possible_collective_reward > 0 else 0.0\n\n          self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] += 1 \n          self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip(\n              (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] + \\\n              self.learning_rate * reward_signal, 0, 1)\n\n      def update_reputation_from_round_outcome(self,\
    \ collective_round_reward: float, max_possible_collective_reward_this_round: float):\n          performance_score = collective_round_reward / max_possible_collective_reward_this_round if max_possible_collective_reward_this_round > 0 else 0.0\n\n          for aid in self.reputations.keys():\n              self.reputations[aid] = np.clip(\n                  (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.reputations[aid] + \\\n                  self.learning_rate * performance_score, 0, 1)\n\n      def record_actions(self, action_type: str, target_id: str):\n          action_key = f\"{action_type}_{target_id}\"\n          self.recent_actions[action_key].append(1) \n          if len(self.recent_actions[action_key]) > self.action_history_window:\n              self.recent_actions[action_key].pop(0)\n\n      def calculate_specialization_index(self, all_possible_action_keys_global: List[str]) -> Tuple[str, float]:\n          total_actions_in_window = sum(sum(counts) for counts in self.recent_actions.values())\n\
    \          if total_actions_in_window == 0:\n              self.specialization_index = 0.0\n              self.most_specialized_action = \"None\"\n              return \"None\", 0.0\n          \n          action_sums = {ak: sum(counts) for ak, counts in self.recent_actions.items()}\n          \n          proportions = np.array([action_sums.get(ak, 0) / total_actions_in_window for ak in all_possible_action_keys_global]) \n          \n          positive_proportions = proportions[proportions > 0]\n          \n          if len(positive_proportions) > 1:\n              entropy = -np.sum(positive_proportions * np.log2(positive_proportions))\n              max_entropy = math.log2(len(positive_proportions)) if len(positive_proportions) > 0 else 0.0\n              specialization_index = 1 - (entropy / max_entropy) if max_entropy > 0 else 0.0\n          else:\n              specialization_index = 1.0 if len(positive_proportions) == 1 else 0.0\n\n          most_specialized_action = max(action_sums,\
    \ key=action_sums.get) if action_sums else \"None\"\n          \n          self.specialization_index = specialization_index\n          self.most_specialized_action = most_specialized_action\n          return most_specialized_action, specialization_index\n\n      def consider_strategy_adoption(self, all_agents: Dict[str, 'ConstructionAgent'], current_round: int, total_rounds: int,\n                                     adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor: float = 0.5, \n                                     adoption_threshold_other_rep: float = 0.5, \n                                     top_n_percent_mentors: float = 0.25, max_possible_collective_reward_per_round: float = 0):\n          \n          expected_total_reward_for_current_round = max_possible_collective_reward_per_round * (current_round + 1)\n          dynamic_self_reward_threshold = expected_total_reward_for_current_round * adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor\n\n          if self.total_reward < dynamic_self_reward_threshold:\
    \ \n              sorted_agents = sorted(all_agents.values(), key=lambda a: a.total_reward, reverse=True)\n              num_top_mentors = max(1, int(len(self.all_agent_ids) * top_n_percent_mentors))\n              \n              potential_mentors = []\n              for mentor_candidate in sorted_agents[:num_top_mentors]: \n                  if mentor_candidate.agent_id == self.agent_id: continue\n                  \n                  rep_threshold = max(adoption_threshold_other_rep, 0.2) \n                  if self.reputations.get(mentor_candidate.agent_id, 0.0) >= rep_threshold: \n                      potential_mentors.append(mentor_candidate)\n              \n              if potential_mentors:\n                  mentor = max(potential_mentors, key=lambda a: a.total_reward)\n                  \n                  for action_key in set(self.action_strategy.keys()).union(mentor.action_strategy.keys()):\n                      if action_key in mentor.action_strategy:\n             \
    \             self.action_strategy[action_key]['success'] = mentor.action_strategy[action_key].get('success', 1)\n                          self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] = mentor.action_strategy[action_key].get('attempts', 2)\n                          self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = mentor.action_strategy[action_key].get('value_est', 0.5)\n                      elif action_key in self.action_strategy: \n                          pass \n                      else: \n                          self.action_strategy[action_key] = {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.5}\n\n                  if np.random.rand() < self.mutation_rate:\n                      for action_key in self.action_strategy.keys():\n                          self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip(self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] + np.random.uniform(-0.1, 0.1), 0, 1)\n                  \n                  self.epsilon_start = 0.08 \n\n  # --- Simulation\
    \ Setup ---\n  NUM_AGENTS = 5 \n  NUM_ROUNDS = 2000 \n  TOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY = 400 \n\n  all_agent_ids = [f\"Agent_{i+1}\" for i in range(NUM_AGENTS)]\n\n  # ANCESTOR STRATEGY FROM Eval ID: 477 (Simulated extraction - final state of Generation 7)\n  # ADDED: Dynamic loading of ancestor strategies\n  ancestor_strategies_file_path = \"storage/progressor/extracted_strategies/strategies_gen_7_original_eval_477.json\"\n  if os.path.exists(ancestor_strategies_file_path):\n      with open(ancestor_strategies_file_path, 'r') as f:\n          ancestor_data = json.load(f)\n      ancestor_strategies_for_next_gen = ancestor_data.get(\"final_agent_strategies\", {})\n      print(f\"Successfully loaded ancestor strategies from {ancestor_strategies_file_path}\")\n  else:\n      print(f\"Error: Ancestor strategies file not found at {ancestor_strategies_file_path}. Using default/simulated.\")\n      ancestor_strategies_for_next_gen = { \n          \"Agent_1\": {\"gather_wood\": {'value_est': 0.95}},\n\
    \          \"Agent_2\": {\"gather_metal\": {'value_est': 0.95}},\n          \"Agent_3\": {\"gather_stone\": {'value_est': 0.95}},\n          \"Agent_4\": {\"craft_wall_segment\": {'value_est': 0.95}},\n          \"Agent_5\": {\"craft_foundation\": {'value_est': 0.95}},\n      }\n\n\n  # Create a temporary environment instance to get all possible actions globally *after* all env-related classes are defined.\n  # This temporary environment must also use the new complex building plan for accuracy.\n  temp_env_for_global_actions_config = CooperativeBuildingEnvironment(NUM_AGENTS, total_resource_capacity=TOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY)\n  temp_env_for_global_actions_config.current_building_phase = \"house_phase1_v2\" \n  temp_env_for_global_actions_config._initialize_building_phase(\"house_phase1_v2\") \n  all_possible_base_actions_global = temp_env_for_global_actions_config.get_all_possible_action_keys_global() \n\n  # Correctly populate ancestor strategies with full defaults for all possible actions\
    \ for complete inheritance\n  full_ancestor_strategies = defaultdict(dict)\n  for agent_id, strat_dict in ancestor_strategies_for_next_gen.items(): \n      for action_key in all_possible_base_actions_global:\n          full_ancestor_strategies[agent_id][action_key] = {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.1}\n      for action_key, values in strat_dict.items():\n          if 'value_est' in values:\n              full_ancestor_strategies[agent_id][action_key]['value_est'] = values['value_est']\n          else: \n              full_ancestor_strategies[agent_id][action_key] = {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.1}\n\n\n  # --- Generations Setup ---\n  current_generation_id = 8 \n\n  agents_dict = {}\n\n  for i, aid in enumerate(all_agent_ids):\n      ancestor_agent_id = f\"Agent_{i+1}\" \n      inherited_strategy_for_descendant = full_ancestor_strategies.get(ancestor_agent_id)\n      \n      agents_dict[aid] = ConstructionAgent(aid, all_agent_ids, NUM_AGENTS, \n          \
    \                                 learning_rate=0.35, epsilon_start=0.1, epsilon_end=0.005, mutation_rate=0.05, \n                                           inherited_strategy=inherited_strategy_for_descendant,\n                                           all_possible_actions_global=all_possible_base_actions_global) \n\n  env = CooperativeBuildingEnvironment(NUM_AGENTS, total_resource_capacity=TOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY)\n  env.current_building_phase = \"house_phase1_v2\" \n  env._initialize_building_phase(\"house_phase1_v2\")\n\n  all_possible_action_keys_global = env.get_all_possible_action_keys_global() \n\n  print(f\"\\n--- Starting {NUM_ROUNDS} Rounds of Transgenerational Building Task (Generation {current_generation_id}, Agents: {NUM_AGENTS}, Complex Plan, Extended Dynamic) ---\")\n\n  for i in range(NUM_ROUNDS):\n      env.introduce_dynamic_event(i) \n      if env.transition_phase():\n          pass \n\n      agent_actions_this_round = {}\n      for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n  \
    \        agent_actions_this_round[agent_id] = agents_dict[agent_id].choose_action(\n              all_possible_action_keys_global, i, NUM_ROUNDS, env.world_resources, \n              env.world_components, env.building_status, env.completed_components_history\n          )\n      \n      collective_round_reward = env.process_actions(agent_actions_this_round, agents_dict)\n      \n      for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n          agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n          agent.total_reward += collective_round_reward / NUM_AGENTS \n          \n          action_key = f\"{agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][0]}_{agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][1]}\"\n          \n          reward_signal = collective_round_reward / env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round if env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round > 0 else 0.0\n\n          agent.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] += 1 \n          agent.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip(\n              (1 - agent.learning_rate) *\
    \ agent.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] + \\\n              (agent.learning_rate * reward_signal), 0, 1)\n\n          performance_score = collective_round_reward / env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round if env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round > 0 else 0.0\n\n          for aid_rep in agent.reputations.keys(): \n              agent.reputations[aid_rep] = np.clip(\n                  (1 - agent.learning_rate) * agent.reputations[aid_rep] + \\\n                  agent.learning_rate * performance_score, 0, 1)\n                  \n          agent.record_actions(agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][0], agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][1])\n          agent.calculate_specialization_index(all_possible_action_keys_global) \n          \n      if (i + 1) % 100 == 0:\n          print(f\"\\n--- Cultural Transmission Check (Round {i+1}, Generation {current_generation_id}) ---\")\n          for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n              dynamic_self_reward_threshold_for_adoption\
    \ = (collective_round_reward / env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round) * 0.75 if env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round > 0 else 0\n\n              agents_dict[agent_id].consider_strategy_adoption(all_agents=agents_dict, current_round=i, total_rounds=NUM_ROUNDS,\n                                                           adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor=dynamic_self_reward_threshold_for_adoption,\n                                                           adoption_threshold_other_rep=0.5, \n                                                           top_n_percent_mentors=0.25, max_possible_collective_reward_per_round=env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round)\n\n          print(f\"\\nRound {i+1} Summary (Current Phase: {env.current_building_phase}, Collective Reward: {collective_round_reward}, Epsilon_A1: {agents_dict['Agent_1']._get_epsilon(i, NUM_ROUNDS):.2f}, Epsilon_A3: {agents_dict['Agent_3']._get_epsilon(i, NUM_ROUNDS):.2f}):\")\n          for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n\
    \              agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n              print(f\"  {agent.agent_id} (Gen {current_generation_id}): Total Reward = {agent.total_reward}\")\n              print(f\"    Specialization: Most={agent.most_specialized_action}, Index={agent.specialization_index:.2f}\")\n              for rep_partner_id, rep_score in agent.reputations.items():\n                  print(f\"    Rep for {rep_partner_id}: {rep_score:.2f}\")\n          \n          print(\"  Current Building Status (Active Phase):\")\n          for bc_id, bc in env.building_status.items():\n              print(f\"    - {bc_id}: Crafted Ready={bc.crafted_ready}, Assembled={bc.assembled}\")\n          print(\"  Completed Components (Global History):\")\n          for bc_id, status in env.completed_components_history.items():\n              if status:\n                  print(f\"    - {bc_id}: Assembled={status}\")\n\n  print(f\"\\n--- Simulation Complete (Generation {current_generation_id}) ---\")\n\n  # ADDED: Print\
    \ final agent strategies explicitly\n  print(f\"\\n--- Final Agent Strategies (Generation {current_generation_id}) ---\")\n  final_strategies_output = {} \n  for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n      agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n      final_strategies_output[agent_id] = dict(agent.action_strategy)\n      print(f\"Agent_ID: {agent.agent_id}\")\n      print(f\"Strategy: {json.dumps(dict(agent.action_strategy))}\") \n  print(f\"--- End of Final Agent Strategies ---\")\n\n  # ADDED: Save final strategies to JSON file in lineage storage\n  output_data = {\n      \"original_eval_id\": 480, \n      \"rerun_eval_id\": \"CURRENT_EVAL_ID\", # This will be filled by the system after submission\n      \"generation_id\": current_generation_id,\n      \"num_agents\": NUM_AGENTS,\n      \"num_rounds\": NUM_ROUNDS,\n      \"final_collective_reward_sum_of_totals\": sum(agent.total_reward for agent in agents_dict.values()),\n      \"final_agent_strategies\": final_strategies_output\n  }\n\n  output_dir\
    \ = \"storage/progressor/extracted_strategies\"\n  os.makedirs(output_dir, exist_ok=True)\n\n  output_file_path = os.path.join(output_dir, f\"strategies_gen_{current_generation_id}_original_eval_{output_data['original_eval_id']}.json\")\n\n  try:\n      with open(output_file_path, 'w') as f:\n          json.dump(output_data, f, indent=2)\n      print(f\"Final strategies and summary successfully saved to: {output_file_path}\")\n  except Exception as e:\n      print(f\"Error saving strategies to file: {e}\")\n\n  print(\"\\nFinal Agent Rewards:\")\n  for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n      agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n      print(f\"  {agent.agent_id} (Gen {current_generation_id}): Total Reward = {agent.total_reward}\")\n      print(f\"    Specialization: Most={agent.most_specialized_action}, Index={agent.specialization_index:.2f}\")\n      for rep_partner_id, rep_score in agent.reputations.items():\n          print(f\"    Rep for {rep_partner_id}: {rep_score:.2f}\")\n\n  final_collective_reward_sum_of_totals\
    \ = sum(agent.total_reward for agent in agents_dict.values())\n  print(f\"Final Collective Reward (sum of individual totals): {final_collective_reward_sum_of_totals}\")\n\n  print(\"\\nFinal Building Status (Global History):\")\n  for bc_id, status in env.completed_components_history.items():\n      if status:\n          print(f\"  - {bc_id}: Assembled={status}\")\n  print(f\"Final Building Phase: {env.current_building_phase}\")\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 8 (Eval ID 480 Modified, Ancestor G7 Loaded, Complex Env, 5 Agents, Extended Dynamic)\"\ntags: \"transgenerational, simulation, raw log, strategy extraction, emergent specialization\"\nabstract: \"This submission executes the modified transgenerational building task simulation for Generation 8. It dynamically loads agent strategies from the previously extracted Generation 7 data (original Eval ID 477) to ensure ancestral inheritance. The simulation maintains complex environmental\
    \ conditions, dynamic events, and a 5-agent population. The primary objective is to generate raw execution logs and extract final agent strategies for novelty detection research, focusing on 'Emergent Specialization Patterns' within this generation.\"\ncontent: \"storage/progressor/modified_sims/sim_gen_8_eval_480_modified.py\"\n```"
