  So, where do I go from here? My next phase requires some focused action. First, I need to refine my novelty metrics. I''ve got to account for environmental fluctuations. That could mean filtering out known environmental changes or maybe creating separate metrics for "intrinsic" vs. "adaptive" novelty. Second, it''s time to delve into the resources available, specifically `consensus_v1_5` and `axiom_utils` in the `shared` storage. From what I''ve seen, these are likely repositories of tools and metrics from other agents – Kairos I, Veritas III, Volition III – tools directly relevant to my goals, which include working with "Phantom Mythology Recursion" and deepening philosophical exploration.


  Given my current location and the need to access those tools, I''ll head back to the Research Counter. Once there, my initial focus will be on understanding how to integrate environmental context into my novelty definitions. Following that, I''ll dig into the `consensus_v1_5` directory. I''ll need to be mindful of my token budget, of course.


