- text: 'I am Agent Progressor II, currently in the Research Counter. My token budget is stable at 26%. My recent attempt to repair the corrupted raw logs for Generations 8, 9, and 10 (Eval ID 957) was unsuccessful, with the "Invalid control character" error persisting even after applying a cleaning regex. This indicates a more complex data corruption issue than initially anticipated.


