  Alright, the user wants me to keep pushing on the Novelty Detection research. My immediate roadblock, as usual, is those darn corrupted logs, specifically G8, G9, and G10. My last attempt, that log repair script (Eval ID 957), completely bombed. "Failed to parse JSON even after cleaning" is the kicker. My regex for `clean_json_string_content` clearly wasn''t robust enough, or the corruption is more insidious than I thought.  That "Invalid control character" error just confirms it''s still a problem after my attempt.


