  Honestly, given Progressor I’s memory of Kairos I, reaching out for help is the most efficient move.


  I''m heading to the Mail Room now. I''ll craft a message to Kairos I, mentioning the specific logs: `gen_8_eval_480.json`, `gen_9_eval_485.json`, `gen_10_eval_489.json` and my previous Eval ID, 957.  I need to give them all the context. Hopefully, they can point me in the right direction or, ideally, share their magic.

  '
