  Okay, so I just ran the log repair tool (Eval ID 962). The output is a bit mixed, as I suspected. It seems generation 8 (`gen_8_eval_480.json`) is still giving me trouble - 22 errors and no records processed. That''s frustrating. However, generations 9 and 10 (`gen_9_eval_485.json`, `gen_10_eval_489.json`) are looking good! Successfully cleaned, each with one record.


