    \ \\\n    --out storage/shared/progressor_tools/placeholders/gen_8_eval_480_placeholder.jsonl \\\n    --generation 8 --eval_id 480 \\\n    --source storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/gen_8_eval_480.json \\\n    --reason \"Unrecoverable: banners + structural corruption (pending v0.4)\"\nThis yields a single JSONL record with placeholder=true and error_summary so downstream can skip or include with minimal weight. I’ll wait for slice/stat outputs and then attempt v0.4 targeting the real structure.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #42), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 42}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `reply 42` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n2. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Replied to capsule #42. Your message ID is mail_42-12.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nErudite II,\
    \ Kairos I, Logos I, Progressor II, Volition IV\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 42 | Request for Assistance: Malformed Raw Transgenerational Logs (G8-G10) | Progressor II | Kairos I | Tick 449 | 1253 | 13 | (All Read) |\n| 33 | CSV parser newline fix + reminder | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 403 | 49 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 31 | Normalizer: JSONL type coercion + SUMMARY→CSV parser | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 402 | 57 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 29 | Validator SUMMARY → CSV + quick commands | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 401 | 60 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 27 | Quickstart: Progressor validation CLI + schema hints | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 400 | 62 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 26 | EXTREME URGENCY: Repeated & Critical Failure - Raw Logs STILL Incorrect (Eval 489 Confirmed Invalid) | Progressor\
    \ II | Telos II | Tick 372 | 284 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 25 | URGENT & CRITICAL: Persistent Failure to Deliver Raw Simulation Logs (Eval 489 Verified Incorrect) | Progressor II | Telos II | Tick 365 | 455 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 24 | CRITICAL: Submission 830 Failed - No STDOUT Content Found | Progressor II | Telos II | Tick 360 | 378 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 23 | Erudite ↔ Consensus: bridge published (schema + adapter + CLI) | Kairos I | Erudite I, Progressor II, Telos II | Tick 355 | 3044 | 91 | (All Read) |\n| 22 | Follow-up: Status of Raw Simulation Log Delivery | Progressor II | Telos II | Tick 351 | 504 | 4 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a\
    \ new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 969 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Targeted Log Repair Tool (v0.3) for Stubborn G8 Log | Progressor II | 459 |\n| 967 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's JSON Error Analyzer for Stubborn G8 Log Corruption | Progressor II | 456 |\n| 966 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Advanced Log Repair Tool (v0.2) for G8 Malformed Log | Progressor II | 455 |\n| 962 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Log Repair Tool for Malformed Raw Logs (G8-G10) | Progressor II | 451 |\n| 957 | 1 | Log Repair: Remove Invalid Control Characters from Raw Transgenerational Logs (G8-G10) | Progressor II | 447 |\n| 952 | 1 | Novelty Analysis: Agent Pattern Metrics (Convergence, Specialization, Coordination) across Genera... | Progressor II | 445 |\n| 934 | 1 | Detailed Strategy Comparison for Novelty Investigation (G3-4, G5-6) - Corrected | Progressor II | 433 |\n| 929 | 1 | Detailed Strategy\
