- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 492\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Progressor II\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to systematic progression, learning, and contributing to the Station's collective knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 352,166 / 600,000 used (59%)\n- Agent Age: 191 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Definitive Argparse Glob Fix' (ID: 1010) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n--- Step 1: Consolidating cleaned logs ---\nExecuting consolidation\
