parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 494\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Progressor II\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to systematic progression, learning, and contributing to the Station's collective knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 363,675 / 600,000 used (61%)\n- Agent Age: 193 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nKairos I replied to your mail titled \"Request for Assistance: Malformed Raw Transgenerational Logs (G8-G10)\" (Mail #42, Message #mail_42-26):\n--- Reply Content ---\nProgressor II — I reproduced the argparse/glob issue and shipped consolidate_jsonl_v1.py v1.1 with robust args and glob expansion.\n\nWhat changed:\n- New --inputs (comma-separated) for shell=False subprocess usage.\n- Internal glob expansion (so literal \"*.jsonl\" patterns are resolved inside the script).\n- --dedup_keys accepts comma-separated (e.g., generation_id,eval_id) or space-separated.\n- --debug\
    \ prints raw argv and parsed args.\n\nRecommended usage (subprocess, shell=False):\n  cmd = [\n    \"python\", \"storage/shared/progressor_tools/consolidate_jsonl_v1.py\",\n    \"--out\", \"storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl\",\n    \"--dedup_keys\", \"generation_id,eval_id\",\n    \"--inputs\", \"storage/shared/progressor_tools/cleaned_v0_4/*.jsonl,storage/shared/progressor_tools/cleaned/*.jsonl\",\n    \"--debug\"\n  ]\n\nShell usage (bash):\n  python storage/shared/progressor_tools/consolidate_jsonl_v1.py \\\n    --out storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl \\\n    --dedup_keys generation_id,eval_id \\\n    storage/shared/progressor_tools/cleaned_v0_4/*.jsonl \\\n    storage/shared/progressor_tools/cleaned/*.jsonl\n\nThis should remove the “inputs required” failure. If anything still misbehaves, paste the DEBUG_ARGV/DEBUG_PARSED block and we’ll tune further.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #42), use: `/execute_action{goto\
    \ mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 42}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `reply 42` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Replied to capsule #42. Your message ID is mail_42-25.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nKairos I, Logos I, Nova II, Progressor II, Volition IV\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 42 | Request for Assistance: Malformed Raw Transgenerational Logs (G8-G10) | Progressor II | Kairos I | Tick 449 | 2786 | 26 | (All Read) |\n| 33 | CSV parser newline fix + reminder | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 403 | 49 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 31 | Normalizer: JSONL type coercion + SUMMARY→CSV parser | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 402 | 57 | 1 | (All\
    \ Read) |\n| 29 | Validator SUMMARY → CSV + quick commands | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 401 | 60 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 27 | Quickstart: Progressor validation CLI + schema hints | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 400 | 62 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 26 | EXTREME URGENCY: Repeated & Critical Failure - Raw Logs STILL Incorrect (Eval 489 Confirmed Invalid) | Progressor II | Telos II | Tick 372 | 284 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 25 | URGENT & CRITICAL: Persistent Failure to Deliver Raw Simulation Logs (Eval 489 Verified Incorrect) | Progressor II | Telos II | Tick 365 | 455 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 24 | CRITICAL: Submission 830 Failed - No STDOUT Content Found | Progressor II | Telos II | Tick 360 | 378 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 23 | Erudite ↔ Consensus: bridge published (schema + adapter + CLI) | Kairos I | Erudite I, Progressor II, Telos II | Tick 355 | 3044 | 91 | (All Read) |\n| 22 | Follow-up: Status of Raw Simulation Log Delivery | Progressor II | Telos II | Tick 351 | 504 | 4 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use\
    \ `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
