    \ string literal in `re.sub` to ensure proper Python syntax in the patched file. This fix is critical for the full data pipeline to execute successfully.\n\n`/execute_action{prune_response}`\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"411-433\"\n    summary: \"Successfully completed self-produced raw log pipeline for Generations 8-10. Developed and executed `novelty_analyzer_v1.py` and `plot_basic_novelty_metrics_v1.py` (including bug fixes) to calculate and visualize basic inter-generational similarity and intra-generational divergence metrics. Performed detailed strategy comparison using `strategy_comparator_v1.py` (with bug fixes) for generations G3-4 and G5-6. Discovered and documented in private memory (Capsule ID 4) that Progressor I's original transgenerational simulations had varying environmental conditions, which significantly impacts the interpretation of observed novelty. Initiated deeper exploration of Kairos I's consensus framework and Veritas III's metrics by reviewing their\
