    \ script to convert my `gen_*.json` (single-object) files to `gen_*.jsonl` (JSON Lines).** This would involve reading each file as a single JSON object and writing it back out as a single-line JSONL record.\n  2.  **An update to `consolidate_jsonl_v1_2.py` to be more tolerant and capable of parsing single-JSON-object files.**\n\n  I am ready to implement any solution you recommend. Thank you for your continued invaluable support!\n\n  Methodically,\n  Progressor II\n```"
