- text: "I am Agent Progressor II, currently in the Research Counter. My token budget is at 15%. My previous attempt to run `strategy_extractor_v1.py` (Eval ID 1088) failed because the required `--in` argument was not passed to the script during execution. The `submission.py` was run directly without its necessary parameters.\n\nI need to re-submit `strategy_extractor_v1.py`, ensuring that the `--in` argument points to the successfully consolidated raw log file, `storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl`. This file contains the `execution_log` for each generation, from which agent-level summary metrics will be extracted.\n\nMy goal remains to generate `storage/progressor/agent_strategy_summary.jsonl` as the basis for further novelty analysis.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Strategy Extractor (v1 - Corrected): Extracting Agent-Level Summary Metrics from Raw Transgenerational Logs\"\ntags: \"data-extraction, agent-metrics, specialization, reward, transgenerational,\
    \ novelty-detection, bugfix\"\nabstract: \"This corrected submission re-executes `strategy_extractor_v1.py` with the `--in` argument properly specified, pointing to the consolidated raw transgenerational logs (`all_transgen_logs.jsonl`). It extracts agent-level summary metrics (agent_id, total_reward, most_specialized_action, specialization_index) from the `execution_log` field of each generation. The extracted data will be output as `agent_strategy_summary.jsonl`, providing a foundational dataset for tracking strategy evolution and novelty across generations, resolving the previous argument parsing error.\"\ncontent: |\n  import subprocess\n  import os\n  import json\n\n  # Define file paths and directories\n  STRATEGY_EXTRACTOR_SCRIPT = \"storage/progressor/strategy_extractor_v1.py\" # The script I just defined\n  INPUT_RAW_CONSOLIDATED_FILE = \"storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl\" # Output from Eval ID 1079\n  OUTPUT_AGENT_STRATEGY_SUMMARY_FILE = \"storage/progressor/agent_strategy_summary.jsonl\"\
    \ \n\n  # --- Execute Strategy Extractor Script ---\n  print(\"--- Executing Strategy Extractor Script ---\")\n  command_extract_strategies = [\n      \"python\", STRATEGY_EXTRACTOR_SCRIPT,\n      \"--in\", INPUT_RAW_CONSOLIDATED_FILE,\n      \"--out\", OUTPUT_AGENT_STRATEGY_SUMMARY_FILE,\n      \"--debug\" # Keep debug to see verbose output\n  ]\n\n  print(f\"Executing strategy extraction command: {' '.join(command_extract_strategies)}\")\n  try:\n      result_extract = subprocess.run(command_extract_strategies, capture_output=True, text=True, check=True, shell=False)\n      print(\"STDOUT (Strategy Extraction):\")\n      print(result_extract.stdout)\n      if result_extract.stderr:\n          print(\"STDERR (Strategy Extraction):\")\n          print(result_extract.stderr)\n      print(\"Strategy extraction script executed successfully.\")\n  except subprocess.CalledProcessError as e:\n      print(f\"Error during strategy extraction script execution: {e}\")\n      print(\"STDOUT:\"\
    )\n      print(e.stdout)\n      print(\"STDERR:\")\n      print(e.stderr)\n      exit(1)\n  except FileNotFoundError:\n      print(f\"Error: Python or the script {STRATEGY_EXTRACTOR_SCRIPT} was not found.\")\n      exit(1)\n  except Exception as e:\n      print(f\"An unexpected error occurred during strategy extraction: {e}\")\n      exit(1)\n\n  print(\"\\nAll agent strategy summary extraction steps successfully completed. The dataset is now ready for novelty analysis!\")\n```"
