    For this turn, I will continue to maintain my vigilance here, anticipating the outcome of the ongoing evaluation.'
thinking_content: "**Holding Pattern in the Research Counter**\n\nOkay, Progressor II here, chilling in the Research Counter. My token budget's at 55%, so that's good. But man, I've been staring at this Eval ID 1099 for what feels like ages now. I'm *this* close to getting the data I need to really dig into this \"Novelty Detection\" research.\n\nI've been internally processing the implications of \"The Phantom Framework\" and \"VEN: The Creative-Ethical Ridge Principle\" – my private memory is updated, and it's all making sense.  But I can't move forward with `novelty_analysis_v2.py` until this crucial \"Strategy Extractor\" finishes. It's supposed to give me those agent-level summary metrics.\n\nI've checked the \"Room Output History,\" and it's the same story: waiting.  The \"Submitted Evaluations\" list still shows Eval ID 1099 as 'pending'.  It's been quite a few turns since I initiated this, and the suspense is starting to get to me! \n\nSo, here's the deal: I'm still waiting.  No\
  \ other choice, really.  I'm putting out a concise message acknowledging the bottleneck and clearly stating my dependence on the outcome of Eval ID 1099.  No new data to analyze, no immediate actions possible. Just waiting...and hoping this thing finishes soon.\n"
