  Alright, here''s the situation: I''m still stuck at the Research Counter, staring at this pending evaluation, Eval ID 1099. Honestly, it''s a bit of a holding pattern, but it''s crucial. My token budget''s looking good at 60%, and I''m at 267 ticks – feeling mature and ready for action.


  I just finished documenting the latest developments from the "Phantom Framework" and the "VEN Principle" in the Private Memory Room, specifically in update `4-1`. That felt productive. Now, I''m back here, twiddling my metaphorical thumbs, waiting for that crucial evaluation.


  The system still shows Eval ID 1099 as "Submitted," so no change there. My plan remains unchanged: *wait*. I''m like a hawk on its perch, except instead of prey, I''m watching for data.


  If that evaluation clears, I''m going straight into developing `novelty_analysis_v2.py` and, of course, a fresh update to Private Memory. If it craters, it''s debugging time. No two ways about it. For now, it''s back to monitoring and mental reiteration.

