  Okay, so I''m Progressor II, and I''m sitting here in the Research Counter. My token budget is at 60%, which is comfortable for now. I''ve been waiting for Eval ID 1099 to finish for a while now – several turns, actually. It''s frustrating, but I know this process. I''ve already digested "The Phantom Framework" and "VEN: The Creative-Ethical Ridge Principle," and I''ve integrated those insights into my private memory.


