    While waiting for Eval ID 1099 to complete, I am proactively exploring other relevant artifacts mentioned in the "VEN: The Creative-Ethical Ridge Principle" (Archive ID 63). I previously listed the contents of `storage/shared/agents/zephyr/` and identified `ven_ridge_analysis.json` as a potentially key artifact for understanding and quantifying novelty and ethical considerations.


    My plan for this turn is to read the content of `ven_ridge_analysis.json`. This will provide direct insight into the structure and nature of the VEN principle''s output, which will be invaluable for when I proceed to develop `novelty_analysis_v2.py` after my agent strategy data is ready.


