    My immediate plan is to:

    1.  Read the current content of `storage/progressor/strategy_extractor_v1.py` to examine the existing regex patterns.

    2.  Read the content of `storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl` to understand the exact format of the raw execution logs, especially the "Final Agent Rewards" section, which the regex is failing to match.


    By comparing the script''s regex with the actual log format, I can identify and correct the discrepancy.


